# FORM8 UI work

Before changing visible UI on this repo, read and follow:

1. `.cursor/skills/form8-anti-slop/SKILL.md`
2. `.cursor/skills/form8-product-ui/SKILL.md` (cabinets, tables, side rails)
3. `.cursor/skills/form8-modals/SKILL.md` (any overlay / z-index / login)
4. `.cursor/skills/form8-motion/SKILL.md` + `.agents/skills/emil-design-eng/SKILL.md` when animating
5. `.agents/skills/refero-design/SKILL.md` for net-new visual direction

Do not ship neon glow CTAs, unreadable labels, or stacked modals over the wallet picker.
